{
  "name": "global_comparator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Comparateur LLM",
        "formDescription": "Comparez plusieurs modèles d'IA sur la même question",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Votre question",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "Ex: Explique-moi la théorie de la relativité en termes simples"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Modèles à comparer",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  { "option": "Ollama (Mistral local)" },
                  { "option": "Google Gemini" },
                  { "option": "Mistral AI" },
                  { "option": "Tous les modèles" }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Température",
              "fieldType": "number",
              "requiredField": false,
              "placeholder": "0.7"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Format d'export",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  { "option": "markdown" },
                  { "option": "json" },
                  { "option": "csv" }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "respondWithOptions": "lastNode",
          "formTitle": "Comparateur LLM - Résultats"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
      "name": "Form Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "position": [200, 400],
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "webhookId": "wh-global-001"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": "sec9GuardWorkflw",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3c4d5e6-f7a8-4b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d7e",
      "name": "Security Guard",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "position": [460, 400],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "security-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "approved",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c5d6e7f8-a9b0-4c1d-2e3f-4a5b6c7d8e9f",
      "name": "Input Safe?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [720, 400],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const formData = $('Form Trigger').first().json;\nconst question = formData['Votre question'] || '';\nconst modelsChoice = formData['Modèles à comparer'] || 'Tous les modèles';\nconst temperature = parseFloat(formData['Température']) || 0.7;\nconst exportFormat = formData['Format d\\'export'] || 'markdown';\n\nconst useOllama = modelsChoice === 'Ollama (Mistral local)' || modelsChoice === 'Tous les modèles';\nconst useGemini = modelsChoice === 'Google Gemini' || modelsChoice === 'Tous les modèles';\nconst useMistral = modelsChoice === 'Mistral AI' || modelsChoice === 'Tous les modèles';\n\nreturn [{ json: { question, temperature, exportFormat, useOllama, useGemini, useMistral } }];"
      },
      "id": "d7e8f9a0-b1c2-4d3e-4f5a-6b7c8d9e0f1a",
      "name": "Parse Form Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [980, 280],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=http://localhost:5678/webhook/ollama",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "chatInput", "value": "={{ $json.question }}" },
            { "name": "temperature", "value": "={{ $json.temperature }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e9f0a1b2-c3d4-4e5f-6a7b-8c9d0e1f2a3b",
      "name": "Call Ollama Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1240, 160],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=http://localhost:5678/webhook/gemini",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "chatInput", "value": "={{ $('Parse Form Data').first().json.question }}" },
            { "name": "temperature", "value": "={{ $('Parse Form Data').first().json.temperature }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f1a2b3c4-d5e6-4f7a-8b9c-0d1e2f3a4b5c",
      "name": "Call Gemini Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1240, 360],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=http://localhost:5678/webhook/mistral",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "chatInput", "value": "={{ $('Parse Form Data').first().json.question }}" },
            { "name": "temperature", "value": "={{ $('Parse Form Data').first().json.temperature }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a3b4c5d6-e7f8-4a9b-0c1d-2e3f4a5b6c7d",
      "name": "Call Mistral Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [1240, 560],
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combineBySql",
        "numberInputs": 3,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b5c6d7e8-f9a0-4b1c-2d3e-4f5a6b7c8d9e",
      "name": "Merge Responses",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "position": [1500, 360],
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO question (question, temperature, max_tokens)\nVALUES ('{{ $('Parse Form Data').first().json.question.replace(/'/g, \"''\") }}', {{ $('Parse Form Data').first().json.temperature }}, 500)\nRETURNING id;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c7d8e9f0-a1b2-4c3d-4e5f-6a7b8c9d0e1f",
      "name": "Save Question to DB",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "position": [1760, 360],
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "PostgresCred001",
          "name": "PostgreSQL - Comparateur LLM"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": "rag7EnhancePrompt",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d9e0f1a2-b3c4-4d5e-6f7a-8b9c0d1e2f3a",
      "name": "Meta Analysis (RAG)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "position": [2020, 360],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": "export8ToFile01",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-c5d6-4e7f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b",
      "name": "Export Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "position": [2280, 360],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const analysisResult = $('Meta Analysis (RAG)').first().json;\nconst exportResult = $('Export Results').first().json;\nconst question = $('Parse Form Data').first().json.question;\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  success: true,\n  question: question,\n  analysis_title: analysisResult.title || 'Analyse comparative',\n  analysis: analysisResult.analysis || '',\n  export_file: exportResult.filename || '',\n  export_path: exportResult.path || '',\n  message: 'Comparaison terminée avec succès !'\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "f3a4b5c6-d7e8-4f9a-0b1c-2d3e4f5a6b7c",
      "name": "Build Final Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [2540, 360],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: {\n  success: false,\n  status: 'rejected',\n  message: 'Votre message a été bloqué pour des raisons de sécurité. Merci de reformuler votre question.'\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "a5b6c7d8-e9f0-4a1b-2c3d-4e5f6a7b8c9d",
      "name": "Rejected Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [980, 560],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Global Comparator - Étape 10 Bonus\nWorkflow intégré combinant toutes les étapes :\n\n1. **Formulaire web** : Saisie question + choix modèles\n2. **Security Guard** : Sous-workflow étape 9\n3. **Routing** : Appel conditionnel des webhooks LLM\n4. **Merge** : Fusion des réponses\n5. **DB Save** : Persistance PostgreSQL\n6. **Meta Analysis** : Sous-workflow étape 7 (RAG)\n7. **Export** : Sous-workflow étape 8\n\n⚠️ Requires webhooks from steps 3, 7, 8, 9 to be active",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "b7c8d9e0-f1a2-4b3c-4d5e-6f7a8b9c0d1e",
